{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e404d97c3dfaa5dd","name":"S-5 Heavy Blaster Pistol","source":{"id":"source:reference-e404d97c3dfaa5dd","title":"S-5 Heavy Blaster Pistol","revision":21733,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:22:41Z","sha256":"5e0cd02d5fb8820d50f3b8d48527cc35bb4beb149a5283b6c71fac19ec882633","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21733","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=S-5%20Heavy%20Blaster%20Pistol&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e404d97c3dfaa5dd","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Star Wars Miniatures Previews"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Star_Wars_Miniatures_Previews"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Theed Arms S-5 combines the firepower of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:7fb29dca115dd7cd"}," with the utility of an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ascension Gun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ascension_Gun","referenceId":"reference:79ba5b865fa46b20"},". This allows the wielder to carry a single weapon that provides for defense, quick ascension capability, and the ability to capture an opponent. A successful hit using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Liquid Cable"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Liquid_Cable"}," feature ensnares a target or securely attaches to a targeted surface. It can lift up to 500 kilograms and has a range of 8 squares.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If the tether is projected vertically, the S-5 Heavy Blaster Pistol can pull the wielder upward at a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," of 8 squares per round. An S-5 can also be used to create a zipline to a target surface after the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Liquid Cable"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Liquid_Cable"}," has been secured to a fixed object at the shooter's location. The zipline allows the wielder to slide along the line at a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," of 12 squares per round if the destination has a lower elevation. In Ascension mode, the S-5 Heavy Blaster Pistol has a maximum range of 8 squares (12 meters).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, an S-5 Heavy Blaster Pistol carries 10 microdarts, which can be fired at a range of up to 6 squares. When fired in this manner, the S-5 Heavy Blaster Pistol deals 1d2 points of piercing damage and inflicts ",{"tag":"a","children":["Paralytic Poison"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Paralytic_Poison","referenceId":"reference:1ee8028672b3471c"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["An S-5 Heavy Blaster Pistol requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 20 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced. Additionally, the S-5 carries only two 20-meter lengths of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Liquid Cable"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Liquid_Cable"},"; after 2 uses, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Liquid Cable Dispenser"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Liquid_Cable_Dispenser","referenceId":"reference:b3813a94e47f0bdf"}," must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d8 or 1d2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1.3 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy or Piercing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Inaccurate:"]}," This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
